# unit_objects_03: unit tests (call) from the start of a Novice race for
# the bank 03 object helpers no play runs: freeing the list at $0325 (empty,
# the last used object, the last two), the two zero returns, the position
# offset, linking a child at the end of a +$27 chain (empty and three long),
# the byte approach of +$17 toward $1F2B (there, within a step, far up, far
# down, past the sign), the two do-nothing entries, the velocity clears,
# the searches of a +$27 chain for a +$48 tag (first, second, none) and the
# spawn with the $A040 handler (got one, free list empty);
# the first-entry table walk of the $0325 list (empty, flag clear, +$08
# bit 0 set and clear, one object and two).
